WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.584
Hold Menu and press pad eleven for Mix. The top two pad rows select tracks. Pad fourteen selects the bass on track two.

2
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:13.330
Turn Q one down a little. We're making room for the drums, rather than making everything louder.

3
00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:17.560
Play Start. Listen to the drums and bass together while you watch their strips.

4
00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:23.543
Pad five mutes the drums. Press it again to bring them back. The bottom two rows are your mute controls.

5
00:00:23.543 --> 00:00:28.134
Hold Shift and pad five to solo the drums. Do it again to hear the full mix.

6
00:00:28.134 --> 00:00:33.570
Press Stop and let the save finish. That's a useful mix check without leaving the hardware controls.
